	  position="Senior Web Developer"
	  aboutMe={`I’m an experienced Senior Web Developer who spends most of my day turning coffee, curiosity, and lines of code into working software. I enjoy experimenting with new technologies, solving challenging problems, and occasionally wondering why the code worked perfectly yesterday.

I’m naturally curious and enjoy projects that push me outside my comfort zone and give me an opportunity to learn something new. I also make it a point to keep up with modern tools, practices, and technologies so I can choose the right solution for the job, rather than simply using the tool I already know.

For me, good development isn’t just about writing code that works. It’s about writing code that makes sense, solves real problems, and doesn’t make the next developer question their life choices.
`}
